.TH XMR\-WALLET 1 2026-10-25 "blocktools 0.1.0" "blocktools manual"
.SH NAME
xmr\-wallet \- host\-side driver for a LOCAL monero\-wallet\-rpc (loopback only; never runs in the sealed image)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
{"error":"rpc must be http://127.0.0.1:PORT (loopback only)","status":"error","tool":"xmr\-wallet"}
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.nf
.RS 2
  xmr\-wallet scan  \-\-rpc http://127.0.0.1:PORT \-\-scan\-req FILE [\-\-open NAME]
      FILE = the 0600 `generate_from_keys` request written by `xmr\-keys \-\-scan\-out` (view key, no spend key).
      Restores the view\-only wallet (or opens NAME), refreshes, prints balance + received outputs (public).
  xmr\-wallet sweep \-\-rpc URL \-\-to ADDR [\-\-net main|stage|test] [\-\-restore\-height N] [\-\-relay] < 25\-word seed
      Restores the seed inside wallet\-rpc, refreshes, builds sweep_all with do_not_relay, checks the plan
      (destination network, amount + fee == unlocked balance), prints it. \-\-relay needs a human at a TTY
      typing the shown code; then relay_tx. Without \-\-relay nothing is broadcast.
.RE
.fi
Seed and view key go only into the HTTP body sent to loopback; never to stdout/stderr.
.SH OPTIONS
See SYNOPSIS; this tool has no separate long\-option list beyond \-\-help.
.SH INPUT/OUTPUT
.nf
.RS 2
      Restores the view\-only wallet (or opens NAME), refreshes, prints balance + received outputs (public).
.RE
.fi
Seed and view key go only into the HTTP body sent to loopback; never to stdout/stderr.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
0
Success (JSON lines may still carry status fields such as done / no_candidates).
.TP
2
Bad input, unsupported shape, or tool\-reported failure (JSON status is the detail).
.TP
3
Refused on purpose (watch\-only, policy deny, human abort, missing confirmation).
.PP
Other nonzero codes are tool\-specific; always read the last JSON status line.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
See recipes/ for end\-to\-end flows. Search for xmr\-wallet in recipes/*.md.
| Monero | ✅ | ✅ xmr\-wallet scan (stagenet) | ✅ xmr\-wallet sweep (stagenet, TTY confirm) | [monero.md](monero.md) |
.fi
.SH SECURITY NOTES
DANGEROUS: audit before use with real funds. See docs/SECURITY.md.
Run secret\-touching tools only inside ./blocktools run (sealed, offline).
